{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_06A170","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Peace Walker之所以是机动核武器，是为了把核威慑能力发挥到最大。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"什么意思？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"必要时不断移动，不让敌人掌握位置……这样，Peace Walker就能避开敌人的先发制人打击。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"也就是说，能够一直把“核报复”这张牌握在手里。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"中南美洲密林很多。就算机体大一点，也到处都有地方藏……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"就像陆地版的导弹核潜艇。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"而且，移动还有另一个目的。Peace Walker搭载的是1Mt<R=级,CLASS>核导弹。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=级,CLASS>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":91,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"它另外还具备自爆功能。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""}]}